              <h1>OVERVIEW</h1>
              <p>Made for a course assignment, <i>ROT</i> is a minimalist endless arcade shooter. Players rotate to aim and fire, with their firing cooldown refreshed on successful hits to reward accuracy over spamming.</p>
              </p>
              <p>The variety of enemy shapes and behaviours are introduced over time as the player survives longer, such as strafing enemies, exploding chain-reactions, and shelled enemies.
